{"title":"매화꽃그늘","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=HsHF4/hAd4Jiflva/MOfEKuXyTC6R9YZa4gO0xk&filename=th3","synopsis":"매화꽃 피는 이른 봄.\n고즈넉한 서원에 세 선비가 서 있다.\n젊은 유생 세 사람은 연정을 우정으로 가린 채 서로의 주변을 맴돈다.\n오랜 세월에 걸쳐 오간 마음들은 얽히고설켜 질척해지고\n어린 시절 서원에서의 앳된 세 사람은 이제 더 이상 존재하지 않는다.\n\n흐드러진 매화에 홀려버렸지.\n말간 깨끗함에 홀려버렸지.\n꽃그늘 아래 서늘한 그림자에 잠겨\n숨이 가빠와도 어쩔 수가 없었지.\n\n그렇게 우리는 함께 잠겨 아득히 흘러갈 테니.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":291,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":203,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-11","rank":274,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-18","rank":273,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-07","rank":298,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-08","rank":298,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-14","rank":236,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-20","rank":257,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-21","rank":269,"change":{"type":"down","amount":12}}],"weekly":[],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-11","v":2394665,"rc":11612,"rs":115110,"cc":2410},{"date":"2026-10-12","v":2394919,"rc":11618,"rs":115170,"cc":2413},{"date":"2026-10-13","v":2395127,"rc":11620,"rs":115190,"cc":2413},{"date":"2026-10-14","v":2395431,"rc":11624,"rs":115230,"cc":2413},{"date":"2026-10-15","v":2395576,"rc":11626,"rs":115250,"cc":2413},{"date":"2026-10-16","v":2395695,"rc":11627,"rs":115260,"cc":2411},{"date":"2026-10-17","v":2395850,"rc":11631,"rs":115300,"cc":2411},{"date":"2026-10-18","v":2396001,"rc":11632,"rs":115310,"cc":2411},{"date":"2026-10-19","v":2396186,"rc":11636,"rs":115350,"cc":2411},{"date":"2026-10-20","v":2396382,"rc":11644,"rs":115430,"cc":2411},{"date":"2026-10-21","v":2396502,"rc":11645,"rs":115440,"cc":2411},{"date":"2026-10-22","v":2396663,"rc":11648,"rs":115470,"cc":2411},{"date":"2026-10-23","v":2396825,"rc"